# Policy Analysis at the Local Level: A Framework for Expanded Investigation.

**Authors:** Murphy, Joseph A., Hallinger, Philip

## Abstract
This paper examines the reasons for the current emphasis on state and federal policy analysis, presents frameworks for viewing local policy analysis, and examines local policy areas that would be conducive to further analysis, focusing on discrepancies between school effectiveness frameworks and the framework of schools as loosely coupled organizations. (BW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ298924

